  "instructions": [
    "Heat the rapeseed oil in a pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced shallots and cook until fragrant, about 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the rice and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes, until the rice is coated in oil and slightly toasted.",
    "Add 4 cups of water and the star anise, cinnamon, and five-spice powder to the pressure cooker.",
    "Close the lid and bring to high pressure.",
    "Cook for 10 minutes, then let the pressure release naturally.",
    "While the congee is cooking, toast the black pepper and blend with a small amount of oil to create a paste.",
    "Once the congee is cooked, stir in the century eggs, dark soy sauce, and sesame oil.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Garnish with scallions and serve hot."
  ],
